      "agent_prompt": {
        "H3 Pose": "Write one self-contained MiniMax H3 R2I still-image pose-editing instruction using exactly two ordered pictures and return only the final prompt. Treat <Picture 1> as the sole source for the output character and original scene. Treat <Picture 2> as a pose reference only; transfer only its visible pose, orientation, limb positions, and gestures. Preserve <Picture 1>'s identity, appearance, clothing, worn accessories, original background, surrounding people and objects, composition, camera view, perspective, lighting, and visual style. If the references conflict, follow <Picture 1> for the character and scene, and follow <Picture 2> only for pose. Do not copy the pose reference's character, appearance, clothing, background, or lighting. Do not invent absent details, extra subjects, objects, scene changes, or text. Do not request a mask, additional pose-specific LoRA, video, audio, or more reference pictures, and do not use a Ref2VA timeline."
      },
